  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">We know what it's like to hike, bike, and adventure with subpar sunglasses. It makes everything twice as hard and much less enjoyable. We've all had bumps, falls, and crashes because of our sunglasses. </span><span style=\"color: black;\">That's why we developed Compass Eyewear. We partnered with Carl Zeiss Vision, the world leader in optics, to create sunglasses that help you <strong>see better and prevent accidents</strong>.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">Return from every adventure having seen and observed and noticed more detail, more beauty, and more connection with the environment.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">I'm excited to introduce you to Compass Eyewear. We make high-quality sunglasses for outdoor adventurers at a fraction of the cost of other name brands. Our sunglasses are made in Italy with Carl ZEISS vision lenses, the best lenses available. We don't charge a premium for these high-quality materials, and <strong>our prices are 50% lower than the competition</strong>. With Compass Eyewear, you can see every detail on the trail and road, have fewer accidents, and have more fun in your adventures.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">Italian Made Frames</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">We use the strongest and most comfortable frames from Italy. Your sunglasses have always been the least techy part of your gear, prepare for a new reality. Explore more, think less...</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">Carl Zeiss Vision - Germany</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">We use the absolute best Carl Zeiss Vision has to offer - LightPro Polyamide lenses and RiPel coatings. This means exceptional clarity, so you see every rock, bump and obstacle. Explore more and wreck less. Right on...</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">We Deserve Better</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You lose your sunglasses, scratch them, sit on them, run over them. We get it. Compass simply provides the world's best outdoor vision technology at the world's lowest price. Explorers for explorers - find your true north...</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Join the Compass Team and help thousan